  "description": "Installation of internally illuminated fascia sign",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed illuminated advertisement, by reason of its scale and level of illumination would comprise an overly prominent, incongruous and discordant feature to the detriment of the character and appearance of the site, the wider surrounding public realm and the living conditions of neighbouring residential occupiers. The proposal is therefore contrary to D4 (Delivering good design) and D8 (Public Realm)&amp;nbsp; the London Plan (2021); Policies LP1 (Design) LP2 (Development and Amenity) and LP7 (Advertisements) of the adopted Hackney Local Plan (2020) and guidance under the NPPF and the Hackney Shopfront Design Guide."
